WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:05.000
Exactly who are you?

00:06.570 --> 00:07.900
That day...

00:07.900 --> 00:11.440
Yes, it all started on that day.

00:11.440 --> 00:13.910
The gears of my fate began to turn.

00:15.810 --> 00:23.550
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

00:23.550 --> 00:30.510
Tooku tooi basho e to

00:43.870 --> 00:50.080
Kaze ni fukare aruite yuku

00:50.080 --> 00:57.040
Umarekita imi o shiritakute

00:57.250 --> 01:03.560
Tatoeba ushinau toki ga kitemo

01:03.560 --> 01:10.690
Dakishimeru koto ima, erabou

01:13.130 --> 01:20.540
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

01:20.540 --> 01:26.510
Nakusenai mono ni mukatte

01:26.510 --> 01:34.160
Kagayaita yume dake o taguriyosenagara

01:34.160 --> 01:41.030
Tooku tooi basho e to

01:53.510 --> 01:55.140
Zed...

02:05.050 --> 02:07.320
Yes, I thought I'd died then.

02:07.320 --> 02:11.060
Episode 26
Lonely Memories

02:23.740 --> 02:24.940
When I woke up,

02:24.940 --> 02:28.670
I was in a completely different world
called " Neotopia. "

02:30.480 --> 02:33.150
These "shards" are amazing.

02:33.150 --> 02:35.210
I can't believe how energetic I feel.

02:36.780 --> 02:38.290
I may be able to heal your wounds,

02:38.290 --> 02:42.020
but I'm afraid I can't completely heal your body.

02:42.020 --> 02:43.290
You've done more than enough.

02:43.290 --> 02:45.780
I am truly indebted to you.

02:46.460 --> 02:48.090
Noah...

02:48.530 --> 02:50.330
Do you have anywhere to go?

02:50.330 --> 02:52.170
Um, well, no.

02:52.170 --> 02:55.870
Then, why don't you stay here
with us for a while?

02:55.870 --> 02:59.440
But I can't allow myself to be
any more of a burden.

02:59.440 --> 03:02.040
We don't mind at all!

03:02.040 --> 03:06.010
We actually have a son who's about your age.

03:06.010 --> 03:09.280
He's off at the capital doing his
military service now.

03:10.320 --> 03:14.320
Say, you know it's not as interesting,
just the two of us here alone, is it?

03:14.320 --> 03:15.520
What do you say, Noah?

03:15.520 --> 03:18.750
If it's all the same to you, feel free to stay here
for as long or short a time as you like.

03:20.630 --> 03:22.600
Thank you very much.

03:27.970 --> 03:30.370
Are you kidding me? That's totally wild!

03:31.370 --> 03:34.030
A completely different world from this one?

03:35.210 --> 03:37.470
I want to go check that out!

03:40.220 --> 03:44.590
Other than Zed, I'd never had any
friends that I could open up to.

03:44.590 --> 03:48.860
That made me all the happier
to meet Keith and Aisha.

03:48.860 --> 03:50.650
And yet...

04:01.000 --> 04:02.770
Where's Noah?

04:02.770 --> 04:06.610
He hasn't come back from Keith's.

04:06.610 --> 04:08.710
Hmm, I see...

04:08.710 --> 04:09.710
Noah?

04:09.710 --> 04:13.150
Oh, he's a very nice boy who's a lot like you.

04:13.150 --> 04:15.510
He's living with us now.

04:19.850 --> 04:20.260
Where are you taking me?

04:20.260 --> 04:21.190
Just come along quietly.
Where are you taking me?

04:21.190 --> 04:22.960
Just come along quietly.
What have I done?

04:22.960 --> 04:25.760
Rescuing and providing shelter to a man
who had collapsed in the street

04:25.760 --> 04:28.160
is a praiseworthy deed.

04:29.960 --> 04:31.100
Gale?

04:31.100 --> 04:36.840
But do praiseworthy deeds entitle us to
neglect the law of the land?

04:36.840 --> 04:38.070
Nay!

04:38.070 --> 04:44.310
Holding the law in contempt for any reason
whatsoever is an act of depravity!

04:44.310 --> 04:48.580
When you come across an individual of
unknown origin, you report this to the capital.

04:48.580 --> 04:51.420
This is a fundamental law.

04:51.420 --> 04:54.150
This man disregarded that law!

04:55.690 --> 05:00.820
Neotopia's ideal is the greatest
happiness for all citizens.

05:01.530 --> 05:05.930
Observance of strict laws is precisely what
will enable us to achieve this ideal.

05:11.240 --> 05:12.870
Gale!

05:15.740 --> 05:17.370
Carter!

05:20.920 --> 05:24.320
Let go! We've got to help Carter!

05:31.730 --> 05:33.700
Why?

05:33.700 --> 05:36.200
How can you be smiling?!

05:36.200 --> 05:39.390
In the name of Absolute Justice,
I now punish you.

05:41.340 --> 05:45.170
Stop it!

05:51.680 --> 05:54.250
Please drink this.

05:54.250 --> 05:58.650
I'm sorry, it's my fault Carter was...

06:02.460 --> 06:04.760
You've done nothing wrong.

06:04.760 --> 06:06.760
We're the ones who are at fault.

06:06.760 --> 06:11.570
We wanted you to stay with us, and
we delayed in giving notice.

06:11.570 --> 06:15.940
But why would they kill Carter,
just because of that?

06:15.940 --> 06:18.130
And Gale is his...

06:19.270 --> 06:22.370
Carter willingly accepted his punishment.

06:23.510 --> 06:26.610
Because that was the right thing to do.

06:26.610 --> 06:30.610
Carter and Gale both did as our
country teaches us.

06:41.600 --> 06:43.600
The soldiers are keeping a close eye
on everyone out there.

06:43.600 --> 06:46.500
It was nearly impossible just to get here.

06:46.500 --> 06:47.940
Who are these guys?

06:47.940 --> 06:49.140
Comrades...

06:49.140 --> 06:52.470
They are all skeptical of the
way this country is run.

06:52.470 --> 06:56.940
With things the way they've turned out,
we can't afford to hesitate any longer!

06:56.940 --> 06:58.570
Keith!

07:09.220 --> 07:11.820
Will you fight with those?

07:13.330 --> 07:15.930
There must be another way.

07:15.930 --> 07:17.800
Fighting isn't the way.

07:17.800 --> 07:19.600
You mustn't do it!

07:21.470 --> 07:24.940
The wind is blowing, Noah.

07:24.940 --> 07:26.570
Keith...

07:27.610 --> 07:29.800
It can't be stopped now.

07:37.720 --> 07:39.690
I love this village.

07:39.690 --> 07:42.520
I love how things used to be between us.

07:42.520 --> 07:45.860
Let's go back to being how we were.

07:47.260 --> 07:49.330
For that we need to have Ratt.

07:49.330 --> 07:51.130
You understand, don't you?

07:51.130 --> 07:54.570
So, don't take Ratt away from us.

07:54.570 --> 07:58.910
That is the kind of selfish thinking that
would destroy our country.

07:58.910 --> 08:03.310
Your actions are beyond despicable, therefore...

08:03.740 --> 08:05.880
I will punish you!

08:05.880 --> 08:07.510
Gale?!

08:09.220 --> 08:10.840
Aisha!

08:12.920 --> 08:14.550
Gale...

08:16.690 --> 08:18.960
Why do you rebel against our country's ideals?!

08:18.960 --> 08:20.900
Why don't you understand?!

08:20.900 --> 08:25.060
Your country's heartless " ideals" don't
mean a damn thing to me!

08:40.650 --> 08:42.720
I didn't retain any memory of the incident,

08:42.720 --> 08:47.480
but it was unmistakably the catalyst of
my awakening as a shard caster.

09:03.340 --> 09:05.130
Is this...

09:06.970 --> 09:10.640
Did I... Did I do this?

09:12.510 --> 09:14.480
Noah...

09:14.480 --> 09:16.110
Aisha?

09:18.720 --> 09:20.350
Noah...

09:23.990 --> 09:26.980
You must not stay here.

09:29.460 --> 09:31.100
I'm sorry, Noah.

09:31.100 --> 09:32.730
Aisha!

09:34.040 --> 09:36.300
Noah...

09:36.300 --> 09:37.930
Live.

09:40.470 --> 09:44.500
If you survive, I know you'll
make it back to Calm.

09:47.180 --> 09:49.620
Farewell, Noah.

10:04.900 --> 10:07.160
The first power I've ever had...

10:12.110 --> 10:15.470
That day remains unforgettable, even now.

10:35.930 --> 10:38.760
I was utterly terrified...

10:39.500 --> 10:41.400
...of my power...

10:42.600 --> 10:45.270
...and of myself.

10:51.880 --> 10:54.120
Thank goodness!

10:54.120 --> 10:57.850
The place Aisha had shifted me to was Zymot.

10:57.850 --> 11:01.480
There, I was rescued by Sagiri and Galva.

11:03.760 --> 11:05.090
You fold it like this...

11:05.090 --> 11:06.720
Okay, done!

11:07.800 --> 11:09.730
Fly it, fly it!

11:09.730 --> 11:12.030
Here it goes!

11:12.030 --> 11:15.260
Wow, cool!

11:16.200 --> 11:18.640
You're a mysterious person.

11:18.640 --> 11:21.940
You've been with us for some time now,

11:21.940 --> 11:24.740
but you haven't asked us anything
about ourselves.

11:26.350 --> 11:28.780
That's true...

11:28.780 --> 11:33.790
One day we will have to go home,
transporting something precious.

11:33.790 --> 11:35.820
Something precious?

11:35.820 --> 11:37.930
The contents of the box in our tent.

11:37.930 --> 11:41.800
I'm sure you've noticed it.

11:41.800 --> 11:43.330
Yes...

11:43.330 --> 11:47.300
Perhaps you could call that our guardian deity.

11:47.300 --> 11:51.440
But as to whether it will bring
peace or catastrophe...

11:51.440 --> 11:55.280
The truth is, even I do not know.

11:55.280 --> 11:58.750
I'm sure it's a god who brings peace.

11:58.750 --> 12:01.080
It must be, if it's your god.

12:04.690 --> 12:07.190
And so I made up my mind.

12:07.190 --> 12:09.160
Thank you for all your kindness.

12:09.160 --> 12:12.090
You don't mean to leave now, do you?

12:12.090 --> 12:14.300
I think that would be best.

12:14.300 --> 12:15.600
I see...

12:15.600 --> 12:18.160
I'm sorry for doing this to you.

12:22.400 --> 12:25.310
Who are you?!

12:25.310 --> 12:27.470
Why are you calling me?!

12:59.210 --> 13:00.210
Noah!

13:00.210 --> 13:02.000
What's happening?!

13:23.430 --> 13:25.630
Th..This is...

13:35.610 --> 13:37.550
Sagiri! Sagiri!

13:37.550 --> 13:39.580
Please, please don't die!

13:39.580 --> 13:41.080
Sagiri!

13:41.080 --> 13:44.750
Someone, please help...

13:44.750 --> 13:47.240
I... I...

13:48.990 --> 13:51.580
Sachura's was a terrible power.

13:53.490 --> 13:55.790
I never dreamed it would destroy
even Galva and the others.

13:56.960 --> 13:59.460
We meet at last.

14:14.580 --> 14:19.020
The people who were kind to me,
and the tranquil time I spent...

14:20.050 --> 14:22.490
I ended up consigning it all to oblivion.

14:26.560 --> 14:28.800
Noah...

14:28.800 --> 14:31.660
What has you up at such a late hour?

14:46.080 --> 14:49.650
No matter how many times you ask me,
my answer will remain the same.

14:49.650 --> 14:54.120
You insist that you cannot aid Neotopia?

14:54.120 --> 14:57.860
I cannot possibly be of use to anyone.

14:57.860 --> 15:03.000
The only power I have is the
power to hurt people.

15:03.000 --> 15:05.830
This power is something I...

15:06.670 --> 15:09.800
Please remember this one thing:

15:09.800 --> 15:14.680
You came to our world to save Neotopia.

15:14.680 --> 15:17.240
That is your fate.

15:22.820 --> 15:25.890
Noah, you must escape, quickly!

15:25.890 --> 15:27.880
It's the resistance fighters!

15:33.730 --> 15:36.160
Sorry, but your life ends here.

15:38.700 --> 15:40.330
Die!

15:46.970 --> 15:49.080
Noah, are you all right?

15:49.080 --> 15:51.510
Uh oh, retreat!

15:51.510 --> 15:53.480
Don't let them escape! After them!

15:58.790 --> 16:01.120
Why...

16:01.120 --> 16:03.920
Why would you shield someone like me?!

16:05.190 --> 16:09.030
Because protecting you was their job.

16:09.760 --> 16:14.640
B..But that doesn't mean they should...

16:14.640 --> 16:18.240
Absolute Law can bring out such strong actions

16:18.240 --> 16:21.000
even from those who are powerless.

16:22.040 --> 16:24.450
Absolute Law?

16:24.450 --> 16:27.920
Why did you not use your power?

16:27.920 --> 16:32.450
If you had, you could have saved them.

16:32.450 --> 16:35.790
No! I mustn't use that!

16:36.790 --> 16:39.860
Your power is not at fault!

16:39.860 --> 16:42.950
It's your weak, fragile heart that is at fault.

16:44.200 --> 16:48.190
The weakness of your heart caused
all your misfortune.

16:49.670 --> 16:54.510
My weak, fragile heart?

16:54.510 --> 16:58.610
Absolute Law breeds a strong heart,

16:58.610 --> 17:01.550
and makes it possible to control your power.

17:02.680 --> 17:05.750
But I...

17:05.750 --> 17:10.360
Noah, you are the chosen one.

17:10.360 --> 17:13.390
Please, use your power to protect
the happiness of the citizens

17:13.390 --> 17:16.830
and our peaceful, beautiful Neotopia.

17:16.830 --> 17:19.400
The tragedies you once experienced

17:19.400 --> 17:23.600
were all brought about by the
disruption of this order.

17:23.600 --> 17:28.440
So please, for precisely that reason,
fight to maintain law.

17:28.440 --> 17:30.970
I know that you are capable of it.

17:31.610 --> 17:34.580
This is fate.

17:43.460 --> 17:45.760
This is my fate.

17:45.760 --> 17:49.260
I want to make sure no one else
experiences such pain.

17:49.260 --> 17:53.260
With this power as the chosen one,
I will maintain law.

17:54.770 --> 17:56.400
Of course.

17:56.740 --> 17:58.360
Of course.

17:58.710 --> 18:00.330
Of course.

18:00.570 --> 18:02.200
Yes...

18:04.240 --> 18:05.870
Of course.

18:12.190 --> 18:14.250
Law is everything.

18:27.100 --> 18:29.090
I'm all right now.

18:34.740 --> 18:36.770
Thank you.

18:37.810 --> 18:42.580
Maintaining Absolute Law, which brings
happiness to so many...

18:44.350 --> 18:47.990
I once did nothing but envy others
as I waited for death,

18:47.990 --> 18:51.150
and then you showed me the right path to walk.

18:59.470 --> 19:04.810
And so I will win the Joust tomorrow,
without fail.

19:04.810 --> 19:09.440
So, that I can teach the world that Neotopia
is the true Absolute Justice.

19:24.690 --> 19:26.490
Zymot!

19:33.400 --> 19:36.940
You have some nerve, showing your face here.

19:36.940 --> 19:39.140
I came for payback.

19:39.140 --> 19:42.470
You may be a brat, but you've got
grown-up guts at any rate.

19:43.210 --> 19:44.850
Why you...

19:44.850 --> 19:47.980
Zed, don't let her provoke you.

19:47.980 --> 19:51.350
Shut your mouth, girl.

19:51.350 --> 19:53.390
Would you like to settle this here?

19:53.390 --> 19:55.180
Stop at once!

19:57.760 --> 19:59.890
Noah...

19:59.890 --> 20:03.600
Acts of hostility outside of the competition
are strictly forbidden.

20:03.600 --> 20:06.600
I believe you have already been notified of this.

20:06.600 --> 20:09.500
If you break the law,

20:09.500 --> 20:11.660
I will punish you here and now.

20:13.710 --> 20:16.240
Can a weak little babe-in-the-woods
like you really do it?

20:16.240 --> 20:18.210
That's enough.

20:25.250 --> 20:27.580
When did these guys get here?

20:28.960 --> 20:32.060
This is Neotopia.

20:32.060 --> 20:35.720
Actions which disrupt order will
absolutely not be tolerated.

20:44.400 --> 20:46.030
Noah...

21:04.020 --> 21:06.650
We're supposed to fight here?

21:14.740 --> 21:20.040
The essence of a Joust is not in winning,
but in fighting!

21:20.040 --> 21:24.040
Battles where we all stake our pride
foster true mutual understanding,

21:24.040 --> 21:28.250
and will surely give as a doorway to
peace between our lands.

21:28.250 --> 21:34.120
And the power of the key spirit which
will be bestowed on the victor

21:34.120 --> 21:37.490
shall become the key which opens
that door of peace!

21:41.030 --> 21:43.190
Key spirit...

21:46.100 --> 21:50.160
May the power of the key spirit go to the just!

21:59.110 --> 22:01.380
We will now begin Match One:

22:01.380 --> 22:05.440
Zed of Templar versus Moreno of Ulvarx.

22:16.830 --> 22:18.630
Interesting...

22:42.020 --> 22:44.620
Kazashita te hiraite

22:44.620 --> 22:47.460
Ano taiyou ni yararesou sa

22:47.460 --> 22:52.420
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tokashite ikou

22:52.770 --> 22:58.410
Atsui jacket nugisute hashiridashita
n da, dakara 6, 7, 8

22:58.410 --> 23:04.370
Nai kaze fukasete ima tobidashite, go!

23:09.420 --> 23:14.820
Yuriokosareta heddo okinuke
ni todoku taiyoukou

23:14.820 --> 23:18.620
Yume o hanatsu ameagari

23:20.330 --> 23:23.060
Kono michi o tobashite

23:23.060 --> 23:30.530
Ichido-kiri no ima to kodou o sagashite

23:31.200 --> 23:33.870
Tsukanda te tsukidase

23:33.870 --> 23:36.640
Ano taiyou mo kowasesou sa

23:36.640 --> 23:41.600
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tobashite ikou

23:42.120 --> 23:47.650
Try again fumidase tameratte
iru no naraba 7, 8, 9

23:47.650 --> 23:53.790
Ten made hibikaseru kono koe dashite, go!

24:17.380 --> 24:20.940
Next Time
Warriors

24:17.880 --> 24:20.940


Next time, "Warriors"
